# v0.4 Phase 9 (D34): real, personal-path-bearing configs. Ship the
# .example.yaml counterpart instead (v0.4 GitHub Publication Plan --
# "No local configuration, API keys, Obsidian contents, prompts, source
# code, personal paths or private logs in the repository"). Each file's
# default loader path resolves to the non-example name below, so a real
# deployment copies the example and fills in its own values.
